    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτιδόρπιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσδ-</span> (which is not
		found), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>serving
				for supper,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄβριμον ἄχθος ὕλης . . , ἵνα οἱ
				ποτιδόρπιον εἴη</span> that it might <i>serve to dress
				his supper,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.234
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				249
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1209
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προσσίτια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
